# AMD RDNA 1/2 (gfx10) shader ISA, wave32: the scalar (SOP1, SOP2, SOPK, SOPC, SOPP, SMEM) and vector
# (VOP1, VOP2, VOPC, VOP3, FLAT/GLOBAL/SCRATCH, MUBUF, DS) encodings. Derived from the GFX9
# module in this directory: every opcode number and field layout was read back from LLVM's AMDGPU
# back end (llvm-mc -mcpu=gfx1030 --disassemble over each opcode of each format), the
# semantics are the GFX9 ones under the RDNA mnemonic. Vector instructions are lifted for one
# lane as in GFX9; lane masks (VCC, compare and carry destinations) are 32-bit SGPRs (wave32).

